WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.022
You are listening to The Common Descent Podcast.

00:00:18.931 --> 00:00:21.132
Hello, Will. Hello, David.

00:00:21.308 --> 00:00:27.190
Hello, listeners, and welcome to episode 89 of The Common Descent Podcast.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:34.132
A few times in the past, we have devoted entire episodes to specific fossil sites or localities.

00:00:34.573 --> 00:00:37.914
Today, we do it again with The Burgess Shale.

00:00:38.194 --> 00:00:41.475
And, man, this is a good site to devote an episode to.

00:00:41.675 --> 00:00:45.537
What? It's such an amazing site. This has got to be, like, one of the...

00:00:45.704 --> 00:00:50.046
It absolutely must be one of the top five most famous fossil sites in the world.

00:00:50.566 --> 00:00:53.167
I don't know what sites would push it out of that.

00:00:53.607 --> 00:00:54.128
La Brea.

00:00:54.268 --> 00:00:54.868
Right?

00:00:55.608 --> 00:00:58.670
La Brea. Yeah, that's up there. Solenhofen? Pretty famous.

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:01.091
