00:03:12.386 --> 00:03:15.688
there has been a lot of discussion and a lot of movement

00:03:16.148 --> 00:03:18.570
regarding the subject of racial injustice.

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:18.910
Yes.

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:24.793
And one of the reasons that this topic has hit this sort of boiling point that it's at now

00:03:25.534 --> 00:03:31.637
is that there is a very long history of too many people in positions of power and influence

00:03:31.766 --> 00:03:33.967
being silent about these issues.

00:03:34.047 --> 00:03:34.267
Yes.

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:38.569
We have decided officially, as the podcast, not to be silent.

00:03:39.049 --> 00:03:42.330
We have released a statement on our social media regarding this issue,

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:43.871
