00:05:24.105 --> 00:05:26.186
as well as our podcast, as well as ourselves,

00:05:26.946 --> 00:05:30.047
and we urge you, our listeners, to do what you can.

00:05:30.328 --> 00:05:34.109
Learn what you can, listen where you can, donate somewhere if you can.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:39.072
It is our hope that we and our audience and our friends and our colleagues

00:05:39.152 --> 00:05:42.313
can all learn to be better and move forward together.

00:05:42.573 --> 00:05:45.355
Yeah, each of us trying to do our parts in the ways we're able.

00:05:45.844 --> 00:05:50.566
Yes, so that we can make our communities and our podcasts that we're making for our listeners

00:05:51.046 --> 00:05:55.348
the best that they can be, accessible to as broad an audience as possible.

00:05:55.488 --> 00:05:55.709
Yes.

