Yes.

00:52:01.245 --> 00:52:18.971
Is that you have this outline, but it also is preserving the outlines of internal structures. So it's like if you were to take both a body impression and an x-ray, which is weird. That's a weird way to be preserved.

00:52:19.687 --> 00:52:38.834
This level of preservation, this type of preservation, leads to the thing that makes the Burgess Shale the most famous thing about the Burgess Shale, perhaps. According to the Royal Ontario site, 98% of the fossils at the Burgess Shale are entirely soft bodied organisms.

00:52:39.314 --> 00:52:39.574
Yep.

