00:57:26.871 --> 00:57:30.132
That they just were binding with iron and that made them sturdier.

00:57:30.792 --> 00:57:39.235
And, once again, special features of the clay, certain clay minerals are apparently known to inhibit bacterial growth.

00:57:39.545 --> 00:57:42.326
